{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22150","headline":"春眠 · 白居易","name":"春眠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新浴肢体畅，独寝神魂安。\n况因夜深坐，遂成日高眠。\n春被薄亦暖，朝窗深更闲。\n却忘人间事，似得枕上仙。\n至适无梦想，大和难名言。\n全胜彭泽醉，欲敌曹溪禅。\n何物呼我觉，伯劳声关关。\n起来妻子笑，生计春茫然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}